    <h1 class="article-title">Power BI vs Tableau for Small Business: Which Should You Choose in 2026?</h1>
    <p class="article-dek">Power BI is usually the better starting point for small businesses in the US and Canada: it costs less per user, fits Excel and Microsoft 365, and rolls out faster. Tableau wins for Mac-based teams, deep visual exploration and Salesforce-heavy stacks. Prices are US list prices as of October 2026.</p>

    <div class="article-byline">
      <div class="article-avatar" style="background:#2E3A55;">LI</div>
      <div>
        <div class="article-author">Lindsay</div>
        <div class="article-role">Consultant, Tycoon Clap</div>
      </div>
      <div class="article-time">10 min read</div>
    </div>

    <div class="article-hero-art">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 700 320" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <ellipse cx="350" cy="300" rx="260" ry="14" fill="#EAF3ED"/>
